var IN=[['MB5 subj','shradhaa@'],['MB4 subj','akansha@'],['MB3 subj','investors@'],['MB2 subj','dealflow@'],['MB6 subj','admin@'],['MB5 rec','shradhaa@'],['MB4 rec','akansha@'],['MB3 rec','investors@'],['MB2 rec','dealflow@'],['MB6 rec','admin@']];
var OUT=[['MB5 sent','shradhaa@'],['MB4 sent','akansha@'],['MB3 sent','investors@'],['MB2 sent','dealflow@'],['MB6 sent','admin@']];
function addrOf(s){s=String(s||'');var i=s.indexOf('<'),j=s.indexOf('>');if(i>=0&&j>i)return s.slice(i+1,j).trim().toLowerCase();return s.trim().toLowerCase();}
function hstr(v){if(!v)return '';if(typeof v==='string')return v;if(v.text)return String(v.text);if(v.value&&v.value[0])return (v.value[0].name?v.value[0].name+' ':'')+'<'+v.value[0].address+'>';return String(v);}
function allAddrs(s){var out=[];var m=String(s||'').match(/[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\.[A-Za-z]{2,}/g)||[];for(var i=0;i<m.length;i++)out.push(m[i].toLowerCase());return out;}
function norm(s){return String(s||'').toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g,'');}
function tsOf(j){var d=j.date||j.internalDate||'';var t=Date.parse(d);if(isNaN(t)&&/^[0-9]+$/.test(String(d)))t=Number(d);return isNaN(t)?0:t;}
function clean(t){t=String(t||'').split('\r').join('');var p=t.indexOf('wrote:');if(p>60)t=t.slice(0,p);var q=t.indexOf('-----Original Message-----');if(q>60)t=t.slice(0,q);var r=t.indexOf('________________________________');if(r>60)t=t.slice(0,r);while(t.indexOf('\n\n\n')>-1)t=t.split('\n\n\n').join('\n\n');return t.trim().slice(0,1400);}

var msgs=[],seen={};
for(var n=0;n<IN.length;n++){var nm=IN[n][0],lbl=IN[n][1];var it=[];try{it=$(nm).all();}catch(e){it=[];}
 for(var a=0;a<it.length;a++){var j=it[a].json||{};if(!j.id)continue;var k=lbl+'|'+j.id;if(seen[k])continue;seen[k]=1;
  var body=j.text||j.textPlain||'';if(!body&&j.html)body=String(j.html).replace(/<[^>]+>/g,' ');if(!body)body=String(j.snippet||'');
  msgs.push({mailbox:lbl,id:j.id,thread:j.threadId||'',from:hstr(j.from),to:hstr(j.to),subject:String(j.subject||''),dateRaw:String(j.date||''),ts:tsOf(j),labels:(j.labelIds||[]).join(','),snippet:String(j.snippet||'').slice(0,140),body:clean(body)});}}

var sentByThread={},sentByAddr={},outN=0;
for(var o=0;o<OUT.length;o++){var on=OUT[o][0],ol=OUT[o][1];var oi=[];try{oi=$(on).all();}catch(e){oi=[];}
 for(var b=0;b<oi.length;b++){var s=oi[b].json||{};if(!s.id)continue;outN++;
  var st=tsOf(s);var rec={ts:st,mailbox:ol,subject:String(s.subject||''),iso:st?new Date(st).toISOString():''};
  if(s.threadId&&!sentByThread[s.threadId])sentByThread[s.threadId]=rec;
  var tos=allAddrs(hstr(s.to)).concat(allAddrs(hstr(s.cc)));
  for(var t2=0;t2<tos.length;t2++){if(tos[t2].indexOf('sidanaventures.com')>-1)continue;var pv=sentByAddr[tos[t2]];if(!pv||pv.ts<st)sentByAddr[tos[t2]]=rec;}}}

var sh=$('Read ONBOARDING').first().json||{};var rows=sh.values||[];
if(!rows.length)return [{json:{fatal:'ONBOARDING read empty'}}];
var hdrRaw=rows[0]||[];var lc=hdrRaw.map(function(x){return String(x||'').trim().toLowerCase();});
var iRN=lc.indexOf('review_note');
var C={status:4,firm:5,contact:6,email:8,sent:27,thread:28,rr:29,rd:30,tsec:31,tstg:32,tchq:33,lf:34,mtg:35,oc:36,ai:37};
var byEmail={},byThread={},firmMap={},meta=[];
for(var i=1;i<rows.length;i++){var r=rows[i]||[];
 var em=String(r[C.email]||'').split(/[,;]+/).map(function(x){return x.trim().toLowerCase();}).filter(function(x){return x.indexOf('@')>0;});
 var m={row:i+1,firm:String(r[C.firm]||''),contact:String(r[C.contact]||''),status:String(r[C.status]||''),sent:String(r[C.sent]||''),thread:String(r[C.thread]||'').trim(),emails:em};
 if(!m.firm&&!em.length)continue;meta.push(m);
 for(var e=0;e<em.length;e++){if(!byEmail[em[e]])byEmail[em[e]]=[];byEmail[em[e]].push(m);}
 if(m.thread){if(!byThread[m.thread])byThread[m.thread]=[];byThread[m.thread].push(m);}
 var fn=norm(m.firm);if(fn){if(!firmMap[fn])firmMap[fn]=[];firmMap[fn].push(m);}}

function exist(row){var r=rows[row-1]||[];return {reply_received:String(r[C.rr]||''),reply_date:String(r[C.rd]||''),thesis_sector:String(r[C.tsec]||''),thesis_stage:String(r[C.tstg]||''),thesis_cheque:String(r[C.tchq]||''),lead_or_follow:String(r[C.lf]||''),meeting_booked:String(r[C.mtg]||''),outcome:String(r[C.oc]||''),added_to_investors:String(r[C.ai]||''),review_note:iRN>=0?String(r[iRN]||'').slice(0,300):''};}
function sentInfo(replyThread,sheetThread,ad){return sentByThread[replyThread]||(sheetThread?sentByThread[sheetThread]:null)||sentByAddr[ad]||null;}

var matched=[],near=[],other=[],oSeen={};
for(var q=0;q<msgs.length;q++){var M=msgs[q];var ad=addrOf(M.from);
 if(ad.indexOf('sidanaventures.com')>-1)continue;
 var hits=byEmail[ad]||[];var how='email';
 if(!hits.length&&M.thread&&byThread[M.thread]){hits=byThread[M.thread];how='thread';}
 if(hits.length){for(var z=0;z<hits.length;z++){var mt=hits[z];var si=sentInfo(M.thread,mt.thread,ad);
   var gap=null;if(si&&si.ts&&M.ts)gap=Math.round((M.ts-si.ts)/1000);else{var sd=Date.parse(mt.sent);if(!isNaN(sd)&&M.ts)gap=Math.round((M.ts-sd)/1000);}
   matched.push({row:mt.row,mailbox:M.mailbox,by:how,firm:mt.firm,contact:mt.contact,status:mt.status,sheet_sent_date:mt.sent,true_sent_at:si?si.iso:'',gapSec:gap,msgId:M.id,thread:M.thread,sheetThread:mt.thread,from:ad,subject:M.subject.slice(0,150),date:M.dateRaw.slice(0,31),iso:M.ts?new Date(M.ts).toISOString():'',labels:M.labels,body:M.body,existing:exist(mt.row)});}continue;}
 var low=M.subject.toLowerCase();
 if(low.indexOf('introducing sidana ventures')>-1){
  var p=low.lastIndexOf(' for ');var guess=p>-1?M.subject.slice(p+5).trim():'';var gn=norm(guess);var cand=[];
  if(gn){if(firmMap[gn])cand=firmMap[gn].slice();else{for(var f in firmMap){if(f.indexOf(gn)===0||(gn.length>4&&gn.indexOf(f)===0))cand=cand.concat(firmMap[f]);}}}
  var si2=sentInfo(M.thread,cand.length?cand[0].thread:'',ad);var g2=null;if(si2&&si2.ts&&M.ts)g2=Math.round((M.ts-si2.ts)/1000);
  var cl=[];for(var c2=0;c2<cand.length&&c2<4;c2++)cl.push({row:cand[c2].row,firm:cand[c2].firm,contact:cand[c2].contact,status:cand[c2].status,emails:cand[c2].emails,sheet_sent_date:cand[c2].sent,existing:exist(cand[c2].row)});
  near.push({mailbox:M.mailbox,from:ad,fromName:String(M.from).split('<')[0].trim().slice(0,50),subject:M.subject.slice(0,150),date:M.dateRaw.slice(0,31),iso:M.ts?new Date(M.ts).toISOString():'',firmGuess:guess,true_sent_at:si2?si2.iso:'',gapSec:g2,thread:M.thread,candidates:cl,body:M.body});continue;}
 var ok=ad+'|'+M.mailbox;if(!oSeen[ok]){oSeen[ok]=1;other.push({mailbox:M.mailbox,from:ad,subject:M.subject.slice(0,100),date:M.dateRaw.slice(0,25)});}}

var sentN=0,recN=0,rowsSeen={};
for(var s2=0;s2<meta.length;s2++){if(/sent|onboard|hold|replied/i.test(meta[s2].status))sentN++;var rw=rows[meta[s2].row-1]||[];if(String(rw[C.rr]||'').trim())recN++;}
for(var m3=0;m3<matched.length;m3++)rowsSeen[matched[m3].row]=1;
var perBox={};for(var p2=0;p2<msgs.length;p2++)perBox[msgs[p2].mailbox]=(perBox[msgs[p2].mailbox]||0)+1;
var statusCount={};for(var s3=0;s3<meta.length;s3++){var k3=meta[s3].status||'(blank)';statusCount[k3]=(statusCount[k3]||0)+1;}

return [{json:{stats:{sheetDataRows:meta.length,statusCount:statusCount,rowsAlreadyHavingReplyRecorded:recN,inboxMessagesSwept:msgs.length,perMailbox:perBox,onboardingSentMailFound:outN,matchedMessages:matched.length,distinctMatchedRows:Object.keys(rowsSeen).length,nearMisses:near.length,otherExternal:other.length},matched:matched,nearMiss:near,otherExternal:other.slice(0,45)}}];
